<title>USA: BrandyWine offering priced at $20.75/shr.</title>
<headline>BrandyWine offering priced at $20.75/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BrandyWine Realty Trust said Wednesday a public offering of 10 million shares has been priced at $20.75 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the offering is expected to close July 28.</p>
<p>BrandyWine said it plans to use the proceeds of the offering primarily to repay advances under its revolving line of credit and for working capital purposes.</p>
<p>The company is a real estate investment trust with 75 commercial and industrial properties containing more than 4.3 million rentable square feet.</p>
</text>
